# Flutter desktop and Apple dependency directories
**/Pods/
**/.symlinks/
**/Flutter/ephemeral/

# Native build/cache outputs not always placed under build/
**/.cxx/
**/.externalNativeBuild/
*.apk
*.aab
*.ipa

# Additional local temporary files
*.tmp
*.temp
*.bak
*.orig
